{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act48side_level_act48side_07_beg","storyGroup":"act48side","storySort":15,"storyDependence":"act48side_level_act48side_st02","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"ME-7","storyName":"奔袭","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"赫卡德墨与自狱中逃离的赞索斯师徒会合。在第一神殿的广场上，期待着文物交换仪式的众人已开始云集。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act48side/level_act48side_07_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act48side_07","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":13,"next":15,"characters":["莱娜","赫卡德墨","赞索斯","吕刻伊昂","伊萨科斯父亲","贝赫努","帕拉斯","佩里安德洛斯","卡珊卓拉","大只的驮兽","梅里塔"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_bg_69_g12_generalroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$sjoyasorrow_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_sjoyasorrow_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$2","duration":"0.7","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#6$1","duration":"0.7","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$2","focus":"l","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"这里是两人份的矿石病抑制剂，从他俩上次注射到现在已经有几天了，最好是见到了就先给他们各注射一支，以免矿石病急性发作。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BD/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"剩下的是些比较常规的药，这一板是止痛的，这些可以增加心肺功能，剩下的可以控制血压和血氧饱和度。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BD/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2","focus":"l","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"不过赞索斯先生有些讳疾忌医，可能不愿意服用，总之你先都带上，硬塞给他，让他身上备着就好。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"矿石病抑制剂一定得注射，其他的就看他自己吧。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"好。这些都是给赞索斯的？那给吕刻伊昂的呢？","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#16$2","focus":"l","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"吕刻伊昂？在他病情的那个阶段，能做的也就是注射抑制剂了。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EB/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-16$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"......已经这么严重了吗......","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$2","focus":"l","id":24},{"type":"multiline","name":"莱娜","text":"还好吧，不用太担心。","id":25},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_plasticbag","volume":"1","id":26},{"type":"multiline","name":"莱娜","text":"先看看这个袋子，我给你们准备了三人份的水和奶酪皮塔派。","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"莱娜小姐，我不是去郊游的......","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$2","focus":"l","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"我知道，带上嘛，万一一会儿肚子饿了呢？","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BD/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"放心，我还给你准备了一些实用的物品。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BD/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"封在这个盒子里的，是一些我特制的香丸，捏开的时候会有迷香的效果。你也带上，以防万一。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BD/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$2","focus":"l","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"不过要当心，如果真需要拿出来用，记得站在上风口，别把自己给迷晕啦。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BD/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"......莱娜小姐......我们不是都安排好了吗？","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"卡珊卓拉小姐帮我们弄到了狱警的换班时间表。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"理事官办公室有监狱牢门和脚镣钥匙的备份，我也复制了——","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E2/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"该不该说百密一疏呢，里底娅小姐似乎完全没有防备，直接把它们摆在了桌上。","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E2/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"劫狱这种事儿这些年里没多少人干过，牢里的警戒不算森严，我掐着时间进去把人带出来就走，应该不至于遇到太大阻碍。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"莱娜小姐不必太过紧张。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#9$2","focus":"l","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"......","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"我知道，我在想的其实是......之后的事。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"您是担心一会儿您拖不住里底娅小姐？还是说，在担心您的未来？","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"确实，虽然劫狱由我实施，但估计里底娅小姐之后也会知道，此事有您参与。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"此后您任职的那家医药公司在雅赛努斯的办事处想要继续发展，说不定会受到一些阻挠......","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2","focus":"l","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"赞索斯和吕刻伊昂毕竟是我的病人——虽然某人不太听话，也不肯好好吃药，接受治疗。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"既然我已做好了准备，打算治病救人，从调香师成为一名专业的医生，那就不能放弃任何一位病人才是。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"有些事，无论代价是什么，该做的总得去做。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"我担心的其实是里底娅......无论如何，我需要与她好好谈谈。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#16$2","focus":"l","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"我的事不用担心，反而是你......","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EB/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-16$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"我也没什么可担心的，莱娜小姐。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"我本来就对这份工作没什么留恋，没辞职也只是想看看有没有可能等到里底娅小姐开除我，给我赔偿金——","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"可惜计划落空了。这是我唯一的遗憾。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7C/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"想到即将踏出这座移动城市，前往更广阔的天地，心里除了微微的忐忑之外，更多的是兴奋和激动。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"莱娜小姐，我听说您也曾被迫离开雅赛努斯——这种心情，想必您也能够体会。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#9$2","focus":"l","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"......是啊。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"你们现在的情形，确实就和我那会儿差不多。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":71},{"type":"multiline","name":"莱娜","text":"你——","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#7$2","focus":"l","id":73},{"type":"multiline","name":"莱娜","text":"你们，以后一定也会好起来的。","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"就像我一样。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":76},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":77},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":79},{"type":"charslot","id":80},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3A/Avg_bg_58_g14_yanprison.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":82},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":83,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":84},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":85},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2","duration":"0.7","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"我们必须想个办法离开这里。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A8/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"不能再这么干等下去了。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A8/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"嗯，最好是能出去找莱娜小姐看看，您的身体——","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"我的身体不重要。","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"文物交接仪式今天下午就会举行。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"若是让萨尔贡人将三城建造时期的工程师手记带走，那日后，这段历史将只能任由他们粉饰。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"必须想办法阻止这件事。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"先等等，赞索斯。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"你是矿石病人，我知道，在与萨尔贡人有摩擦的边境上，这些年里有许多像你这样因为战事而得病的人。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"......是。","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A8/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"很多人流离失所，丧失了家园，他们过得非常辛苦，而你，来到雅赛努斯后，靠自己站稳了脚跟。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"你已经可以在这儿开启新的生活，为什么还要参与这样的事？","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"......或许正因为我是矿石病人。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"我所剩无几的短暂生命，必须用来做一些在我看来更有意义的事。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"那你也是个被英雄梦束缚的米诺斯人。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"矿石病会隔绝英雄气概，自从离开故乡，英雄梦就已经离我很远了。我没有想过那些。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"是吗？","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"没想到......","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"伊萨科斯这小子，去边境还真是交了一个很好的朋友。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"......","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"这里的守卫，十五分钟之后会换班，你们趁这个机会出去。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"出门后先往左走，在第二个岔口向右，再之后若是出现岔口都往右，只要能在五分钟的换班空当内出去，应该不会碰上守卫。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"最后你们会抵达后厨，现在这段时间，后厨应该没有人。你们可以从那里出去。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"......","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"哦，对，还有脚镣。来，过来，我替你们打开。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"......为什么......","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"为什么？我为什么不走？唔，我的情况和你们不太一样——在这死牢里，不仅有要处决的囚犯，还有些得被关到死的人，比如说我。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"嘿，一辈子管吃管住的，我为什么要走？在这片大地上，哪儿不都一样？","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"还是你想问为什么我会做这些准备？万一呢，对吧，你看，现在不就用上了。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":134},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fetterfts","volume":"1","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"好了。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"......谢谢您。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"用不着。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"我不知道你出去之后会怎么做，但想来应该很难再在这座城市立足，我们今后很可能再也不会碰面了。","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"伊萨科斯为他的英雄梦而死，神谕昭示了他的未来。那是我们都无力阻止的事。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"但你不一样，你还没有得到属于你的神谕，在遥远的将来......也许......","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊萨科斯父亲","text":"在那之前，先好好地活着吧。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":147},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":148},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":149},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":150},{"type":"charslot","id":151},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_bg_69_g7_firsttemple.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":152},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":153},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":154,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2077_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"这些石材，这几座半成品雕塑，还有那座脚手架，这些东西不都还没有清理干净吗？","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"虽然知道你们懒散惯了，但效率竟然如此低下......真是让人震惊。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2077_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":160},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"还有你们的理事官，这么重要的时刻，她人去哪儿了？！此刻在这里接待我的人，应该是她才对！","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"......我们之前就与缇缇小姐商定了仪式该如何准备。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"仪式需要的场地已经清空，扩音器与射灯等设备已安装完毕，观众席也已经设置好了引导牌与座位牌。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"需要做的准备我们都做完了，至于您指出的那些，原本就不是必要的。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2077_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"梅捷缇克缇？她人都不知道逃到哪儿去了。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B4/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"现在萨尔贡使节团的负责人是我，帕拉斯小姐，您应当关注的是我的需求。","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B4/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"而我，认为你们的准备做得完全不够，无法匹配萨尔贡与米诺斯的文物交换这样重要的仪式。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B4/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"诚然如您所说，这是一场重要的仪式，我们会在剩下的时间里尽可能地让场地的状态趋于完美。","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"但作为合作方，我也得提前问问您——","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1","focus":"m","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"贵方要交接给我们的，于我们米诺斯人、于我们第一神殿而言最重要的文物——克瑞斯拉的竖琴，请问它现在的状态如何？","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"往近了说，前日在码头，它掉落在地上，似乎磕得挺严重，听说贵方打算修复，现在修好了吗？","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"往远了说，虽然我不知道你们的帕夏与里底娅小姐究竟是如何达成的这一约定，但我一直很好奇，其中是否已加入了鉴定的环节？","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2077_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"......帕拉斯小姐，您管得有点宽了。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B4/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"我们已与理事官达成了一致，这将是一场盛会，据她说，甚至连远在拉刻代蒙和科林尼亚的祭司都会前来观摩。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B4/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"这对您和您的神殿来说，也是一场前所未有的亮相，您应该将全副心思都放在为此做好准备上。","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B4/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"其他的事，都不需要您操心。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B4/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"您说得是。那我们就拭目以待下午的盛会了。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2077_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":190},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":191},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":192},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":193},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#10$1","duration":"0.7","id":195},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"多么趾高气扬的萨尔贡人啊。真意外，您居然能忍得下来。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"还是说，你们神殿其实另有打算，这会儿只是在看丑角表演的戏码？​","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"丑角？你在说你自己吗？​","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"你在雅赛努斯活动得有些久了，科林尼亚人。​","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"据我所知，雅赛努斯农场出售给科林尼亚的苹果已全部装箱完毕，你为何还滞留在此？​","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"我是科林尼亚的神殿祭司，除了关注商业买卖，偶尔也需要出席一些重要的场合——你们的理事官邀请了我。","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"而且，于我们科林尼亚人而言，已经清账的交易属于过去，更重要的，是为未来寻找机会。​","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"所以你就一直像只阴沟里的鼷兽似的到处嗅闻？里底娅又许了你什么好处？​","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"只要出价，就可以向你们购得一切吗？包括你们的尊严，你们的良心，甚至你们的灵魂？​","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"都可以，只要您出得起价。​","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"......​","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"帕拉斯小姐，您与其关注我，不如多留意尚未现身的人。​","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1","focus":"m","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"......你是说理事官里底娅？确实，她和她的执笔人理应出现在这里，但现在，两人似乎都还未到场。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"那两位啊，可能都被什么私事绊住了脚吧。​","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"我指的是别人——刚才那位萨尔贡人也说了，你们的理事官里底娅小姐邀请了外城的祭司。​","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"从科林尼亚来的人是我，那么，从拉刻代蒙来的祭司呢，她人又在哪儿？​","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1","focus":"m","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"......​","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"想想吧，前祭司小姐，那可是拉刻代蒙人，固执、死板、严肃，遇事只会以武力解决的野蛮人。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"拉刻代蒙的这位，据我所知，是雅赛努斯出身，却因为某种不为人知的理由，自幼被带到了拉刻代蒙，在神殿长大。","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"虽说她身上还保留着一些雅赛努斯的元素，或许是某种纪念，但她接受的，却是最正统的拉刻代蒙式祭司教育。​","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"蝉联了三届拉刻代蒙格斗大赛的冠军，最后以完全符合标准的优异成绩成为最年轻的祭司。​","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"这样一位了不起的大人物，来到雅赛努斯观礼，若是见到了什么意外的乱象，会做出怎样的反应，我确实相当好奇。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"实话告诉您，聪慧的前祭司小姐，这才是我还滞留在雅赛努斯的真正原因。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E3/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1","focus":"m","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"......","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":235},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":236},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":237},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footstep_stonestep","volume":"0.6","channel":"step","loop":"false","id":238},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step","fadetime":"2","id":239},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":240},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":242},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"你来了，正好，先替我一会儿吧。眼下第一神殿需要一位主持大局的人。","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"我得去找缇缇。我刚刚套了萨尔贡副使的话，恐怕她窃琴的计划未能成功，我有点担心她。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1","focus":"m","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"如果她失败了，那我打算在交换仪式上说破这件事......之后该怎么办，也得与她商量。","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"就是不知道她现在人在哪儿，我来之前刚去过旅店，没见到她......","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"她在郊外的驮兽牧场。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8C/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"牧场......？为什么？","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"去找她吧。然后，若是见到神迹，你会发现，你担心的这一切就都不会再成为你的阻碍。","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DF/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1","focus":"m","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"......","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"别忘了我昨晚对你说过的话。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DF/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":260},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":261},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":262},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":263},{"type":"charslot","id":264},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":265},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":266},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":267,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":268},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstpwalk","volume":"0.7","loop":"true","channel":"walk1","id":269},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":270},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"walk1","fadetime":"2","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":272},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"老师，好像有人过来了。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"......是我们走错路了吗？","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"应该没有。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"还好听脚步声对方只有一个人。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"都已经到这里了，不可能放弃。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"你躲到那边的角落，等对方经过，就打晕了捆起来扔到空的牢房里。","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"好。","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"动手的时候捂住他的嘴，别让他发出声音。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":288},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":289},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":290},{"type":"charslot","id":291},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":292},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":293},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstpwalk","volume":"0.7","loop":"true","channel":"walk2","id":294},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":295},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#8$1","duration":"0.7","id":297},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"唉，一会儿见到了，该怎么开口好呢？","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":301},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"walk2","fadetime":"1","id":302},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","delay":"0.2","id":303},{"type":"multiline","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"唔......","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","random":"true","power":"8","times":"50","duration":"0.5","id":306},{"type":"multiline","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"呜啊？！","id":307},{"type":"dialog","id":308},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","volume":"0.8","id":309},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cnstrctnck","volume":"1","delay":"0.4","id":310},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":311},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.7","id":312},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":313},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fightgeneral","volume":"0.6","id":314},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch02","volume":"1","delay":"0.3","text":"","id":315},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch","volume":"0.8","delay":"0.9","text":"","id":316},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"唔呃呃——呃唔啊——好痛——谁打我——呜唔唔——啊——啊？","id":318},{"type":"dialog","id":319},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":320},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":321},{"type":"charslot","id":322},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":323},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#10$1","id":324},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":325},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":326},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":327},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"......怎么会是你？","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":330},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":331},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":332},{"type":"charslot","id":333},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_bg_69_g5_athenusalley.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":334},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":335},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footsteps_flock","volume":"1","id":336},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"咳咳，总算平安出来了。我们先躲到这里吧。","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"......辛苦你了。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"没事！能平安把你们带出来就好！","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7C/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"接下来才是最麻烦的......得把你们送到山口古道上去，卡珊卓拉小姐已经在那儿备好了你们会用到的文件和行李。","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E2/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"我们过去时尽量小心，不要引人注意。希望狱警晚一点儿发现你们人不见了的事......","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E2/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"......卡珊卓拉小姐她......","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"她很担心您，还是说，您想与她道别之后再离开？也是，应该的。","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"multiline","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"但她现在人应该在第一神殿，当下万众瞩目的地方，要过去恐怕有些困难。","id":352},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":353},{"type":"multiline","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"让我想想......","id":354},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":355},{"type":"dialog","id":356},{"type":"charslot","id":357},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_pcknmrn","channel":"step1","loop":"false","volume":"0.3","id":358},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step1","fadetime":"5","id":359},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":360},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"那边，好像有动静。","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"是狱警发现了？这么快？！","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"好像不是......有野兽的嘶鸣。","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":367},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#10$1","focus":"n","id":368},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gntbstoi","volume":"0.5","id":369},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":370},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"是驮兽！","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"为什么市区里会有驮兽？！","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":375},{"type":"charslot","id":376},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gntbstoi","volume":"0.9","id":377},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_beastsherd_run","volume":"0.6","delay":"0.7","id":378},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"-1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"8","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大只的驮兽","text":"哞——！","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"一大群驮兽朝我们冲过来了！","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"老师！","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":385},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":386},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":387},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":388},{"type":"charslot","id":389},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_bg_69_g11_firsttemple_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":390},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":391},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"0.8","fadetime":"0","id":392},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":393},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.3","id":394,"musicid":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":395},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":396},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"缇缇说他们萨尔贡人带来的琴是假的。","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"......","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7A/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1","focus":"m","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"你并不惊讶？","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"这个问题我之后会与她谈谈。我现在想找的是你。","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7A/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"这些天来，你一直在仰赖那位萨尔贡小姐为你操持第一神殿的相关事务。","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7A/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1","focus":"m","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"我以为这个问题我们已经讨论过了，究竟是谁在台前主持并不重要。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"但她替代不了祭司的位置。","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"只有祭司，才最了解神殿所供奉的英雄和奉请英雄的祭祀仪式，还有仪式上最重要的那些戏剧的剧目。","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"也只有祭司，才能在演出时让英雄的精神凝聚。","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"在克瑞斯拉第一神殿，这是只有你才能做到的事，连我也无法替你完成。","id":413,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7A/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1","focus":"m","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"......","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"不要再推脱了，帕拉斯。","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7A/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"我明白的，自我回到米诺斯的那一日起，我就不会再逃避必须由我承担的责任。","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":420},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":421},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":422},{"type":"charslot","id":423},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_bg_69_g4_athenusstreet.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":424},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","id":425},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":426},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":427},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":428},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":429},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":430},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"真是让爱操心的祭司小姐担心了......等事情结束之后请她喝酒赔罪吧。","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B2/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"唔，不知道她昨晚和缇缇聊了什么，刚才急着出来都忘了问......","id":433,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B2/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"还有，“神迹”是什么啊？","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B2/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"真是的，我算是明白“智慧自苦难中来”这句话的意思了。","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1","focus":"m","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"以前做祭司的时候还不觉得，现在自己亲身体会了，才发现祭司们这种说话遮遮掩掩的毛病有多可恶。","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"缇缇......这会儿又在驮兽牧场做什么呢？","id":439,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":440},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":441},{"type":"charslot","id":442},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_gntbstoi","volume":"1","id":443},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_beastsherd_run","volume":"1","delay":"1","id":444},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"-1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"8","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":445},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":446},{"type":"dialog","id":447},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_keeprunning","volume":"1","channel":"step","loop":"true","id":448},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step","fadetime":"2.5","id":449},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅里塔","text":"帕拉斯小姐！小心！","id":451},{"type":"dialog","id":452},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodenship_impact","volume":"0.8","id":453},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_planeshake","volume":"0.6","delay":"0.4","id":454},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_beastsherd_run","volume":"1","delay":"2","id":455},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$chasing_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act5d0/m_bat_chasing_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":456,"musicid":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":457},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":458},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":459},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":460},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"8","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"false","block":"true","id":461},{"type":"background","id":462},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":463},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A8/Avg_69_i07.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","id":464},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":465},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":466},{"type":"text","text":"一开始，似乎只是很远处传来了嘶鸣声，帕拉斯正在街道上匀速地骑行。","id":467},{"type":"text","text":"但几乎就在一转眼间，那些隐约的动静扑面而来，成了在街上横冲直撞的驮兽群。","id":468},{"type":"text","text":"几十头驮兽带着无可抵挡的气势甩开追在身后的治安官和牧民，挤走路上的行人，撞飞街边的小摊。","id":469},{"type":"text","text":"它们戴着头巾，应该都来自郊外的牧场，而郊外的驮兽牧场——","id":470},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"那不就是卡珊卓拉说缇缇在的地方？","id":471},{"type":"text","text":"这些原本温驯的动物，似乎受到了某种惊吓，以它们庞大的身躯，形成一道奔腾的洪流，向着与牧场相反的方向直冲而去。","id":472},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"队伍最末尾的那只驮兽......它的角上似乎有什么东西——","id":473},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"为什么......它的角上卡着一把竖琴？！那难道是......克瑞斯拉的......","id":474},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"这就是卡珊卓拉说的“神迹”？！","id":475},{"type":"dialog","id":476},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":477},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":478},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":479},{"type":"charslot","id":480},{"type":"image","id":481}],"characters":["莱娜","赫卡德墨","赞索斯","吕刻伊昂","伊萨科斯父亲","贝赫努","帕拉斯","佩里安德洛斯","卡珊卓拉","大只的驮兽","梅里塔"]}